# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- Learn about the [Qiskit primitives](/guides/primitives) that the Qiskit Runtime primitives are based on.\n"
"- Review detailed [Estimator](/guides/estimator-examples), [Sampler](/guides/sampler-examples), or [Executor](/guides/executor-examples) examples.\n"
"- See the input and output details for [Estimator](/guides/estimator-input-output), [Executor](/guides/executor-input-output), and [Sampler](/guides/sampler-input-output).\n"
"- Practice with primitives by working through the [Cost function lesson](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) in IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
"- See the [EstimatorV2 API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/estimator-v2), [SamplerV2 API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/sampler-v2), and [Executor API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/executor).\n"
"- Read [Migrate to V2 primitives](/guides/v2-primitives).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Empfehlungen\">\n"
"- Lerne mehr über die [Qiskit Primitives](/guides/primitives), auf denen die Qiskit Runtime Primitives basieren.\n"
"- Sieh dir detaillierte [Estimator](/guides/estimator-examples)-, [Sampler](/guides/sampler-examples)- oder [Executor](/guides/executor-examples)-Beispiele an.\n"
"- Schau dir die Eingabe- und Ausgabedetails für [Estimator](/guides/estimator-input-output), [Executor](/guides/executor-input-output) und [Sampler](/guides/sampler-input-output) an.\n"
"- Übe mit Primitives, indem du die [Lektion zu Kostenfunktionen](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) in IBM Quantum Learning durcharbeitest.\n"
"- Lies die [EstimatorV2 API-Referenz](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/estimator-v2), [SamplerV2 API-Referenz](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/sampler-v2) und [Executor API-Referenz](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/executor).\n"
"- Lies [Migration zu V2 Primitives](/guides/v2-primitives).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
